{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q1616640","formula":"C₆Br₆","hill":"C6Br6","elements":["C","Br"],"composition":{"C":6.0,"Br":6.0},"names":{"en":"Hexabromobenzene","ru":"Гексабромбензол"},"descriptions":{"en":"Hexabromobenzene (HBB) is an organobromine compound with the formula C6Br6. It features a central benzene ring with six bromine substituents. Hexabromobenzene is a white powder that is not soluble in water but is soluble in ethanol, ether, and benzene.","ru":"Гексабромбензол (сокращённо ГББ) — химическое броморганическое соединение с химической формулой C6Br6. Состоит из бензольного кольца где все атомы водорода замещены на бром. Представляет собой моноклинные иглы или же белый порошок, не растворим в воде, но растворим в этаноле, эфире и бензоле."},"fame":11,"pubchemCid":6905,"mass":551.5,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1(=C(C(=C(C(=C1Br)Br)Br)Br)Br)Br","inchikey":"CAYGQBVSOZLICD-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"1,2,3,4,5,6-hexabromobenzene","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"6905","atoms":12,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":3.067,"y":-1.277,"z":0.0,"el":"Br"},{"x":0.427,"y":-3.294,"z":0.0,"el":"Br"},{"x":2.639,"y":2.017,"z":0.0,"el":"Br"},{"x":-2.639,"y":-2.018,"z":0.0,"el":"Br"},{"x":-0.427,"y":3.294,"z":0.0,"el":"Br"},{"x":-3.067,"y":1.277,"z":0.0,"el":"Br"},{"x":1.288,"y":-0.536,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":0.18,"y":-1.383,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":1.108,"y":0.847,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.108,"y":-0.847,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.18,"y":1.383,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.288,"y":0.536,"z":0.0,"el":"C"}],"bonds":[[0,6,1],[1,7,1],[2,8,1],[3,9,1],[4,10,1],[5,11,1],[6,7,2],[6,8,1],[7,9,1],[8,10,2],[9,11,2],[10,11,1]]},"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1616640","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url